GASES 3-42 : Contents
---------------------
1) Running eg clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file.m :
   multiple steps such as
     edit freq_boundaries.m to set output dir name for gas gid
     edit and run loop_filelist_gN.m to make the output dirs for all gases,
       and list of gid/chunk/toffset to be made .. see gN_ir_list2.txt
     submit job using    sbatch --array=1-2800%128 --output='/dev/null' sergio_matlab_chip_makegas3_42.sbatch 1
     check progress of individual gases using                         filelist_gN.m                  to see which fles of gis still need to be done
     when happy with what you see, and jobs have ended, run           loop_filelist_gN_missing.m     to remove empty files
     Note things are gonna fail past job ID 20000  : so at that point when first 20000 are made, edit
       clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file
     so it processes job+20000, and appropriately edit
       bobs_not_done.sc
     so the jobsIDs are 20000 less
     
GASES 51-81 : Contents
----------------------
1) Basics only needed since all effort spent on gases3-42
   multiple (simpler) steps and this should really run very fast
     edit freq_boundaries.m to set output dir name for gas gid (already done for molgas)
     edit and run loop_filelist_xsecN.m to make the output dirs for all gases,
       and list of gid/chunk/toffset to be made .. see gN_ir_xseclist2.txt
     submit job using    sbatch --array=1-900%128 --output='/dev/null' sergio_matlab_chip_makegas51_81.sbatch 1
     check progress of individual gases using                         filelist_xsecgN.m                  to see which fles of gis still need to be done
     when happy with what you see, and jobs have ended, run           loop_filelist_xsecN_missing.m     to remove empty files

